Time Effect - Timeline Bridge - Knowledge	VISIBLE:NO	TEMPBONUS:ANYPC|SKILL|TYPE.Knowledge|floor(%CHOICE/2)|TYPE=Insight	TEMPVALUE:MIN=1|MAX=100|TITLE=Choose the effect caster level	TEMPDESC:Knowledge check bonus only. Permission to attempt Knowledge checks untrained is resolved at the table; this does not grant ranks. Remove when the effect ends, including when spent for a defensive revelation. Enter caster level when cast, not recipient level. Duration, concentration and spell points remain player-managed. Haste and Slow require an opposed magic skill check to counter each other; do not simply apply both. Remove when the effect ends.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/time
Time Effect - Timeline Bridge - Single Attack Defense	VISIBLE:NO	TEMPBONUS:ANYPC|COMBAT|AC|floor(%CHOICE/2)|TYPE=Insight	TEMPVALUE:MIN=1|MAX=100|TITLE=Choose the effect caster level	TEMPDESC:Enable ONLY against the single attack chosen when spending a spell point and an immediate action to end Timeline Bridge. Remove the Knowledge effect separately, then disable this bonus after the attack. Enter caster level when cast, not recipient level. Duration, concentration and spell points remain player-managed. Haste and Slow require an opposed magic skill check to counter each other; do not simply apply both. Remove when the effect ends.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/time
