Time Effect - Rapid Response - Three Selections	VISIBLE:NO	TEMPBONUS:ANYPC|SAVE|Reflex|4|TYPE=Competence	TEMPVALUE:MIN=1|MAX=100|TITLE=Choose the effect caster level	TEMPDESC:Use only when the caster has selected Rapid Response three times. Replaces the two-selection Reflex bonus. Evasion and uncanny dodge upgrades remain player-managed; no permanent class features are granted. Enter caster level when cast, not recipient level. Duration, concentration and spell points remain player-managed. Haste and Slow require an opposed magic skill check to counter each other; do not simply apply both. Remove when the effect ends.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/time
Time Effect - Broken Time	VISIBLE:NO	TEMPBONUS:ANYPC|COMBAT|TOHIT|-floor(%CHOICE/2)	TEMPBONUS:ANYPC|SKILL|ALL|-floor(%CHOICE/2)	TEMPVALUE:MIN=1|MAX=100|TITLE=Choose the effect caster level	TEMPDESC:Apply only after a failed Will save. Attack rolls and skill checks only; does not penalize saves, damage or ability scores. Casting requires a separate concentration check against the caster MSD. Resolve that check and the new free-action Will save each round at the table. Enter caster level when cast, not recipient level. Duration, concentration and spell points remain player-managed. Haste and Slow require an opposed magic skill check to counter each other; do not simply apply both. Remove when the effect ends.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/time
