Time Effect - Age - Young Adult to Middle Age	VISIBLE:NO	TEMPBONUS:ANYPC|STAT|STR,DEX,CON|-1	TEMPDESC:Received Age, changing from Young Adult to Middle Age. Apply only if the original age penalties are already represented. Use one Age transition at a time; replace rather than combine transitions. Mental scores and permanent age remain unchanged. The caster must be able to shift the required number of categories (1 plus floor(caster level/5)). Saving throw, concentration, spell points and expiration remain player-managed. Remove when the effect ends. Child/youth and object aging are not covered.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/time
